Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.45,0:00:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着脸色真差\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look horrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.27,0:00:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多久没睡过安稳觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you really slept a night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们专心工作好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just work, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小丑杀手 我知道你在琢磨什么 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killer clown. I know what you're thinking, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「为何一定要是小丑呢」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Why did it have to be clowns?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我忘了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think I remembered, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每次一在电视上看到麦当劳叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you still bust out crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是会哇的一声叫出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever you see Ronald McDonald on the televiison.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码我不害怕坐飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I'm not afraid of flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞机可能会失事 - 而小丑显然会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Planes crash. - And apparently clowns kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:34.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们伤不了我 他们伤不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hurt you. They can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「会流血的怪物就能被杀死」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If it bleeds, you can kill it."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,「会流血的怪物就能被杀死」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If it bleeds, you can kill it."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.91,0:01:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第14集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蛋头人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am the eggman."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧弗兰克 非得用付费电话联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Frank, pay phones? I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意碰一下都能染上淋病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting the clap off this thing just touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗雷德·萨维奇（美国电影演员） 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred Savage? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道 食人怪无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I know, big mouths are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你问起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, since you asked,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点迪克·罗曼的实际情报再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}some actual intel on the Dick Roman guy would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, good looking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他能赶紧找到线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope he finds something quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,每日换暗号的这套真让我崩溃死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole protocol du jour thing's really creeping my cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克那边鸟线索都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got dick on Dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这说话够生动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a vivid way of putting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到娘子军的线索了吗 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You find anything on wonder woman? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能永远找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there probably won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们消失得无影无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are definitely gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.77,0:02:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但堪萨斯州那边可能有情况发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I might have found something over in Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.96,0:02:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我要定几条规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, a few simple rules, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.53,0:02:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准和小孩打交道 孩子他妈也不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No babies. In fact, no baby mamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准去酒吧 不准喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bars. No booze …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥样的辣妞都不准碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}no hot chicks of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你刚才的意思是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Did you just say …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去生个怪物宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You spawn a monster baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你还想不想马上再去泡妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}see how quick you want to dive back in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.61,0:02:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种吻痕可不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are not the fun kind of hickeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这是章鱼干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're … you're saying an octopus did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一般的章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just any octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据伤痕的直径判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on welt diameter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是北太平洋巨型章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enteroctopus dofleini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就没个通俗点的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for those of us who skipped the enteroctopus class?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,北太平洋巨型章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giant pacific octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能有多大 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How giant we talking, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,将近九米长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approximately 30 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边巨型章鱼不是很罕见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, aren't… giant octopi rare around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是被我们遇上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下班回家 喝了瓶啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy comes home, cracks a beer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后被章鱼吸死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gets…suckered to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 这起攻击是某种怪癖所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, this was some kind of freak fetish attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人造出了这些吸痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone created those hickey marks,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后放干了他的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}then bled the man out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得咬痕有点吸血鬼风范吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bite look a little vamp-y to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要追查的是啥样的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是章鱼吸血鬼 还是吸血章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}An octovamp? A vamptopus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是对于咱们 这事都够疯狂的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy even for us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实超出咱们的承受范围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does push the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.01,0:03:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们去找他的遗孀聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go chat up the widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你节哀顺变 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very sorry for your loss, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:04:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈珀太太 我们知道来的不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Harper, we know this is, uh, bad timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有几个例行问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we just have a few routine questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要问你 可以吗 - 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that we need to ask you … is that okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们家房子最近有什么异样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the house feel any different lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么异样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different…?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何诡异的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说冷点（某区域因超自然生物影响而温度骤降）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有闻到什么奇怪的味道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, did you smell anything weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe sulfury?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我不记得有这些怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not that I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.87,0:04:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们只是逐条排除一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're just ticking all the boxes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你丈夫有什么不可外扬的丑事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, what about any skeletons in your husband's closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑事 你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skeletons? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想到会有谁想伤害他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you think of anybody who would want to do him harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,同事或是旧情人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A colleague, an old flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,再小的事也会有所帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tiniest detail could really help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想知道他最近都做了什么好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what he was up to lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,去问史黛西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask Stacey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死的那晚 她在我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was here the night he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,史黛西是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stacey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.92,0:04:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮了不少忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的款待 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really appreciate the hospitality, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈 老爸 保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, dad, nanny …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这简直就是从色情书刊里扒下来的三角恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that is a love triangle right out of casa erotica.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过在黄色故事里\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course, in those,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,妒火中烧的妻子会把怨念付诸行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}the jealous wife tends to channel her feelings more productively.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一想不通的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I can't wrap my mind around is …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妻子是怎么把章鱼吸血鬼召唤来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, how wife lady summoned an octovamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like "why?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不切实际 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, kind of impractical, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩得有人去跟那个狐狸精保姆谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, one of us needs to go talk to the naughty nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个人留在这里 等妻子走后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other one stay here, shake down the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把房子彻查一遍 看看我们对付的是啥样人\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the wife leaves … see what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我去跟保姆谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm on the nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我去找保姆谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm on the nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说不碰辣妞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said no hot chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道她很辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that she's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能描述一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, uh, how would you describe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和死者的关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}your relationship with the deceased?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知该怎么说 正常关系吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Normal, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:05:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.37,0:06:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我基本只和黛布拉接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mostly dealt with Debra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间没什么 如果你是想问这个的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing going on, if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛布拉说那天深夜你在他们家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Debra said that you were at the house late the night that…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是布莱恩死的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Brian died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.78,0:06:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩那天加班 我就留下来陪凯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian was working late, so I stayed with Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她心情很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was pretty upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天是她的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在神勇乐园开了生日派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a party at Plucky's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,神勇乐园 怎么听着这么耳熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plucky's. Why does that sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,神勇口哨奇乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plucky Pennywhistle's Magical Menagerie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿童披萨连锁店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza chain for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实更多是为迎合懒父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, more for lazy parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 他爸就露了五分钟的面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, her dad showed up for five minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又回去上班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he went back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 她妈不在镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, her mom was out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个蠢孩子跟凯利说 她父母都不爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stupid kid told Kelly her folks didn't really love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她难过坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哄了她好几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was calming her down for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有发现房子里有些什么奇怪的现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, did you…notice anything weird at the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个奇怪法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird like…?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行 就算是一个不好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything. Even a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.43,0:06:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 没有那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 凯利好像挺害怕衣柜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, Kelly does have a weird thing about closets,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但小孩子都那样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's just kid stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她认为她的衣柜里有个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks there's a monster in her closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大家都快逼疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It drives everyone crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找错调查对象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we talked to the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管那母亲了 去和她女儿谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, forget the mom. Talk to the daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爸爸庆生会中途离开 她很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's mad at her dad for ditching her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日恶愿 一发不可收拾之类吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A birthday wish gone wrong, something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就看着她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a 20 on her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,您能去和她聊聊而不触发安珀警报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get to her without tripping the Amber Alert?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 看你能查出什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, see what you can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干吗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatcha working on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.28,0:07:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那个问我妈问题的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the guy that talked to my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是问过你妈妈问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我妈发现我跟你说过话 她会很生气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom will get mad if I talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…how come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我告诉那些警察的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of what I told the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都告诉警察什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you tell the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他们我曾想给我爸提个醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told them that I tried to warn my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他那怪物要对他下手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the monster would get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly. Come here! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:40.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（此刻）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「会流血的怪物就能被杀死」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If it bleeds, you can kill it."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说有匹马 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, the horse I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有蹄印 跳过那围栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hoofprints, the jumping over the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他被什么东西扎透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, what ran him through?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是个什么大东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best thing I could tell you is something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 类似长矛那种吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, like a lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女士得把他八岁的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady's got to pull her friggin' 8-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从学校里叫出来 告诉他他爸爸不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of school and tell him his dad's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.21,0:10:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯探员 联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Jones, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我真得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I-I really need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:11:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你不介意的话 就问一个小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh, just one quick question, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天是不是你儿子的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, was yesterday your son's birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利的生日吗 不是 你为什么问这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy's birthday? No. Why would you ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.19,0:11:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天他爸确实带他去一个朋友的庆生会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}his father did take him to a friend's birthday party yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.03,0:11:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得神勇口哨奇乐园连锁店吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You remember a chain called Plucky Pennywhistle's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 我记得你很喜欢那些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Could have swore you loved those places.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.15,0:11:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 伙计 我恨那些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, dude, I hated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是丢下我 自己去追女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you would dump me and go trolling for chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是我把你扔在监狱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I left you in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些地方不是很有意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, those places are supposed to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思 它们很逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun? Uh, they're lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们到处都是臭味\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they smell like puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰激凌一点都不细腻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the ice cream is all grainy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别再抱怨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't have one of your episodes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说许恶愿不可收拾这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying I hit a dead end with this whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个死胡同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}wishes-gone-wild thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:12:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这两个孩子都去神勇乐园玩过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but both kids were at Plucky's day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不去当地的神勇乐园查一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, why don't you go check out the local Plucky's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去问一问那个叫比利的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I ask about this Billy kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, w-why don't I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是等你回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't I just wait for you to get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No can do, hermano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要去和比利聊一聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way to talk to little Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.10,0:12:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不让我现在去和比利聊一聊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why … why … why don't I talk to Billy…right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是因为你害怕小丑 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about your, uh, your clown thing, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.85,0:12:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.55,0:12:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们到底把你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what in the world did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what? Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要记住99.99%的小丑都不是你的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just know that 99.99% of all clowns can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 会流血的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? And if it bleeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能被杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「会流血的怪物就能被杀死」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If it bleeds, you can kill it."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:48.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神勇口哨奇乐园）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:52.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（在这里 你的梦想都是好的）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来玩太老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到神勇乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Plucky's,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 你的梦想都是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where all your dreams are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you just, uh, maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我叫下经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}just get the manager for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要你再安静待上三个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to stay sane for three more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗 给你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,做作业啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.01,0:13:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这我还能学习啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I can concentrate in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,画的真不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real beauties, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每周就展出一批\N{\fnArial\fs30}We rotate them out once a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们都喜欢把他们的画挂在墙上让大家看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids love having their art on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「画出自己最怕的东西」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Draw your worst fear"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不会把特别可怕的展示出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't post the truly evil stuff …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有那些普通的东西 像鲨鱼 鬼怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the standard crap like sharks and ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是简·霍乐戴 值班的经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean Holiday, shift manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰逊 联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnson, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初为什么想到让孩子画这些恐怖的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}why even ask the kids to draw creepy stuff to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种心理练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an exercise…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,某位热门心理学家提出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}some pop psychologist came up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 老板很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, the owner's obsessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「帮助孩子们成长」\N{\fnArial\fs30}with "aiding children's development."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,托盘纸是一种可靠的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the place mat is a safe way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让孩子们谈谈他们的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get kids to talk about their fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让他们画完后放进一个盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we get them to sketch it in a little box,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后「哇」的一下 神勇小丑就把它们变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … vola! … plucky magically transforms it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹或是糖果什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}into rainbows and candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.37,0:15:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人认为这有点扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I think it's a load of hooey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们说如果任由这些恐惧发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they say that if these fears run wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会影响这些孩子的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it affects kids long into their adulthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我…我听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've … I've … I've heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是否记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…so, I don't know if you'll remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天这有一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there was a kid in here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫比利·波尔 来参加一个聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Billy Pogue for a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那个歇斯底里的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the conniption kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,歇斯底里 他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conniption? He … he had …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是说他 他没事 是他爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, not him. He was fine. It was his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋糕和礼物上来之前 他就把他孩子带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulls the kid away before cake and presents,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那孩子问能不能多待五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I guess the kid asked to stay for another five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那做爸爸的就开始犯浑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dad pulls a full-frontal douchebag,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.57,0:15:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲孩子大吼大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}starts screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让孩子很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just embarrassed for the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:15:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah. I'm a fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在调查什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you investigating?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,几起奇怪的命案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of crazy deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你知道什么情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, is there something you want to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不方便说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里人太杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,打烊以后再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back after closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出小镇命案的真相了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the lowdown with Trauma Town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个死者都不是很称职的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither vic was up for parent of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利的爸爸忽略了她的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly's dad skipped her birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.07,0:16:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利的爸爸犯浑 出丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Billy's dad pulled one of those dick parent scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大家都吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that makes everyone cringe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.81,0:16:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿童心理治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,画出自己最怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, you draw your worst nightmare …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,噗 神勇小丑能帮你完全摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poof! … Plucky fixes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把图画挂到一面大墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, they hang them up on this big wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真让我没话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can't argue with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱尔兰小妖的确很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leprechauns are deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 凯利画了只怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, Kelly draws a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后怪物就追上了她父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then that goes after her father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这里 他们给每张画贴标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's the thing. They label those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜哪两幅画不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess which two were missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓名标签还在 托盘纸却不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, name tag was there … no place mat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吸血章鱼那幅吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little miss octovamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还有比利的画 也就是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And…Billy. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎么 他画的怪物活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, whatever he drew came to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后骑着马杀了他爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and killed his dad, riding a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近了 不过还不够厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close, but no Seabiscuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我和比利聊了聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I went and had a little chat with Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我画了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he drew me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽也邪恶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now unicorns are evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 显然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.99,0:17:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 现在问题就在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Well, now the question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽怎么能从画里出来杀掉比利的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did a unicorn come off a sketch and kill Billy's dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事怎么发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's any of this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天工作结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'll head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有小孩在球坑里吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kid puked in the ball pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,得进行彻底清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna need a full sanitization.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干完这活你就能打卡下班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that, and then you can clock out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让下路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on one second there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,经理在球坑里发现了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The manager found the body in the ball pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里到处是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops have a theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为是洗球机惹的祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they think the ball washer did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么机 - 洗球机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The what? - The…ball washer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洗啥机 - 洗「球」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The what? - The ball …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:19:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是鲨鱼咬的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a shark bite. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,从半径来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, judging from the radius,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少长20英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say a 20-footer, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:13.96,Title,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你怎么能没看过《鲨鱼周》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Shark Week, " Man. How do you not watch that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一整周都是关于鲨鱼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole week of sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥马·	库珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omar Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜猜小奥马怕鲨鱼的可能性有多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much you want to bet little Omar here was scared of sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和门卫索尔又有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Saul the Janitor is connected how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.21,0:20:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和奥马并不是亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's not related to Omar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不是 但索尔本想告诉我一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But Saul had something he wanted to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这跟杀掉混蛋父母无关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this isn't about ganking some dickweed parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是杀人灭口\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like, uh, silencing a whistle-blower?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 看来我们要找的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, so whatever we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以随意让童年噩梦成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}can literally fire off childhood fears at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.28,0:20:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得小心邪恶的午餐大妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Watch out for evil lunch ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.05,0:20:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这里清查一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's comb this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是吸血章鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dractopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是捅人独角兽神马的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seabiscuit the Impaler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.07,0:21:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有陆上鲨鱼 下面会是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land shark … what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 泰勒 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Tyler, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得在这里搭大巴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to take the bus from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:47.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（此刻）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是幻像怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…Tulpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 杀戮范围太广\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, killings are too spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.09,0:22:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的小分队没那么有想象力 你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little imaginative for the god squad, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.11,0:22:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那会是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So…what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know. I'm tapped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.29,0:22:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.83,0:22:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们知道它在哪里出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least we know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在神勇乐园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plucky's!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者都是在那儿被选中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the victims are getting picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.41,0:22:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们昨天仔细搜过了 什么也没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we swept the place last night, and nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以再去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.29,0:22:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,找员工问问 或许能挖出点事来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the employees, maybe dig up some dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能起什么作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good's that gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为你是联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think you're a fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个本来要告密的家伙挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one guy who was gonna rat, he got bruced.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.39,0:22:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使有人知道些什么 他们也不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anybody knows anything, they're not gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.51,0:23:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Yep. That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.26,0:23:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再去一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go back…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.61,0:23:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当个恶棍警察 给他们施压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play bad cop, really lean into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我搞定 你就观察他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…when I'm done, then you watch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人害怕了 那就是我们找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if somebody freaks out, then that's our creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是你跟踪他 顺藤摸瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he'll lead us closer, and you can track him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我伪装成什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's my cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.62,0:23:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 在那儿逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Just hang back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.29,0:23:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现正常点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Act normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.16,0:23:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个30多岁的男人独自在神勇乐园闲逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Guy in his 30s hanging out at Plucky's alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.89,0:23:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再正常不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.94,0:23:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not pervy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.46,0:23:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管人们怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it doesn't matter what people say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经用绳子围起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've roped it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.19,0:23:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经通知了主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've notified the powers that be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都知道了 别让人进来就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's aware. Just no one goes in the…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.59,0:23:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.69,0:23:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.91,0:23:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,生意如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's business?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来即使是可怕的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out not even grim flippin' death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也阻挡不了庆生会\N{\fnArial\fs30}can slow down the birthday fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.89,0:23:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们已经用绳子围起球坑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We roped off the ball pit, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到总部派人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until corporate can get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.12,0:23:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信机器会如此失控把索尔弄成那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe the machine fritzed and did Saul in like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.03,0:23:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.29,0:23:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你们的一些员工谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need to talk to some of your employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.44,0:24:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.07,0:24:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.69,0:24:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大号彩虹弹簧圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giant slinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.21,0:24:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候最喜欢那东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have killed for one of those when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.59,0:24:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.27,0:24:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一千张票 - 多少美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 1, 000 tickets. - American dinero. How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.30,0:24:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在神勇口哨乐园里不收现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we don't take cash here at Plucky Pennywhistle's.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只收通过努力和坚定赢得的游戏券\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only tickets won through hard work and determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.65,0:24:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你王老吉喝大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mainlined the kool-aid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.15,0:24:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天周二 玩投分球有双倍游戏券\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's double-ticket Tuesday if you play skeeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.01,0:24:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.65,0:24:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where were you last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.77,0:25:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.65,0:25:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是明摆着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.65,0:25:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我发现他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.27,0:25:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直在收银台旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was by the cash register the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.47,0:25:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个监控摄像头正对着收银台\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a security camera pointed right at the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.95,0:25:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察已经看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops already looked at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都没听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you heard nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.83,0:25:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了喷球机的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the ball blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听见他呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.12,0:25:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我听见了 肯定会冲进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I did, I would have run in, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.37,0:25:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.70,0:25:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的说辞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's your excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.77,0:25:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.53,0:25:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我刚做这份工作 但是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know I'm new to this job, but I'm …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.49,0:25:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.06,0:25:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做了多久 - 几周的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How new? - Couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.25,0:25:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚升职\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.63,0:25:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位子竞争大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, was there a lot of competition for the gig?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.57,0:25:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有一些福利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes with benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.51,0:25:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板让我们所有人都写了关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bosses had us all write essays.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.77,0:25:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎样为孩子尽心尽力的论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how we would do our best for the kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.61,0:25:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们选了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they picked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吃惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be shocked,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.43,0:25:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实在大学里学过两个学期\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I actually did two semesters at college, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.80,0:25:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没惹什么麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in any kind of trouble, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.69,0:26:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 不如你来告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Why don't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.95,0:26:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我并不完美 但是我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know I'm not perfect, but I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.79,0:26:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定不会做违法的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I mean, it's not as if I'd ever do anything illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.46,0:26:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.13,0:26:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.35,0:26:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你知道 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.40,0:26:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很仰慕你们的职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I really appreciate what you do, and …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.86,0:26:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.01,0:27:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.29,0:27:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没 别胡闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him. Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.73,0:27:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混蛋 - 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jackass. - Jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyler, soup's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.96,0:27:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 妈妈 我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Mom, I don't want …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.93,0:27:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.90,0:27:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这个很难吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.31,0:27:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别难为她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why don't you cut her some slack?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.56,0:27:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,关你什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.77,0:27:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我以前也和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I've been where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.06,0:27:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈也让你放学在傻逼神勇乐园待着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom made you camp at a stupid Plucky's after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.23,0:27:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y… no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.07,0:28:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我爸会拽我去很多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but my dad, he…hauled me places.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.06,0:28:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 她工作很辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, she's working a tough gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.19,0:28:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她快累死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? She's exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.38,0:28:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该体恤长者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should take pity on the old.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.87,0:28:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有吃的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, hey, free grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.00,0:28:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意味道像屎一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stuff tastes like butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.38,0:28:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.10,0:28:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 没这么差吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it can't be that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.35,0:28:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.35,0:28:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.34,0:28:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕机器人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared of robots?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.33,0:28:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有激光眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have laser eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.70,0:28:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.53,0:28:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 朋友 你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, friend! What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.43,0:28:43.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迪恩手机 不是他）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.49,0:28:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头摘下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.71,0:28:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.51,0:28:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,做 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do…what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.38,0:28:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.53,0:29:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.37,0:29:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.14,0:29:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.37,0:29:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥就代表联邦政府 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the federal government, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.75,0:29:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做什么就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.63,0:29:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我说就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.04,0:29:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.29,0:29:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.38,0:29:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们是为比尤特爆炸的冰毒车间的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is about the meth lab that fireballed up in Butte,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.59,0:29:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.50,0:29:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我兄弟干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it was my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.67,0:29:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们指纹是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, um, we got the same fingerprints, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.07,0:29:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这是我最好的一份工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. This is the best job I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.21,0:29:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.19,0:29:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克里夫 - 克里夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cliff. - Cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.41,0:29:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有用孩子们的梦魇杀人吧 克里夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not using kids' nightmares to smoke people, are you, Cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.49,0:30:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有…吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.05,0:30:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.74,0:30:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.60,0:30:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,摊牌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, cards up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.78,0:30:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不管你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we don't care that you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.58,0:30:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝命毒师了 还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, broke bad or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.75,0:30:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是乐园里有真正的怪事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is some seriously weird going on in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.85,0:30:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说半地下室吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the sub-basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.09,0:30:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方还有半地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place has a sub-basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.64,0:30:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 入口就在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Door's out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.93,0:30:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不知道 就不容易发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy to miss if you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.91,0:30:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.71,0:30:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alls I know is…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.00,0:30:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和索尔以前下班后有时就会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Saul used to come in after hours sometimes and…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.01,0:30:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在球坑里磕过药吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever shroom in a ball pit?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.45,0:30:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才…不会 探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I…would, agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.74,0:30:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是索尔 只有索尔 就他一个人磕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Saul. Just Saul. All alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.16,0:30:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.47,0:30:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我们会听到很诡异的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we'd hear, like, spooky stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.75,0:30:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,从通风口传来\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the vents…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.78,0:30:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是锅炉房传上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming up from the boiler room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.03,0:30:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了孩子 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, kiddo. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.99,0:30:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人偷了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But somebody stole it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.40,0:30:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就再画一幅\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, draw another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.00,0:31:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.37,0:31:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.13,0:31:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个托盘纸反正也挺难看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place mat sucked anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 怎么了 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.03,0:31:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去充黑猫警长的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you were out being Dirty Harry,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.89,0:31:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒的妈妈生他气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, Tyler's mom got pissy with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.82,0:31:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在他的托盘纸不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now his place mat's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.15,0:31:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得讨厌的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the bitchy mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.19,0:31:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上可怜的孩子 再加上\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus, uh, sad kid plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.82,0:31:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,画着疯狂的东西的托盘纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}place mat with something nuts written on it…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.61,0:31:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等于离奇死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}equals wacky corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.56,0:31:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为她是下一个要遇害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think she's next on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.38,0:31:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一 我来跟踪他们 而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll tail them just to be safe. You …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.11,0:31:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去查查锅炉房 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the boiler room. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.48,0:31:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你知道他画了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Dean, hey, uh, any idea what he drew?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.52,0:31:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.03,0:31:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机器人 - 没错 大约一栋楼高\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Robot? - Yeah, about the size of a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.97,0:31:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,从眼中射出毁灭性射线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoots destructo beams out of its eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.93,0:32:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我知道该防备什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I'll see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.02,0:32:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切可真正常啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's perfectly normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.37,0:32:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.26,0:33:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 现在把枪踢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. Now kick it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.63,0:33:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这里有挺多巫术用具啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some pretty heavy hoodoo you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.40,0:33:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不得不说 据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta say, as far as I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.65,0:33:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没一样东西是能召唤独角兽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of these things, uh, can poop out a unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.14,0:33:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧中自有力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's power in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.80,0:33:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个小孩画出他害怕的东西时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when a child draws what he's afraid of,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.81,0:33:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部分魔力就会封存在画纸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little of that mojo ends up on the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.99,0:33:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你将它扔进火里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you toss it in the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.51,0:33:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后恐怖夜谭就真实上演了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some bed-wetter's horror show comes to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.90,0:33:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也得从父母身上拿点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get something off the parent, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.29,0:33:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拥有的一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something they own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.11,0:33:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部分有点难\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bit gets tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.47,0:33:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点小困难看来没影响你的进度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it hasn't seemed to slow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.51,0:33:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是做了该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just doing what I need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.09,0:33:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.07,0:33:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 成不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.39,0:34:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有画的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No drawing…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有铁皮巨人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No iron giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.81,0:34:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是要杀那个婊子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that b-word is still on the list!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.68,0:34:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.13,0:34:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要钓大鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.30,0:34:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你要朝我开枪吗 霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you gonna shoot me, Howard?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.95,0:34:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想亲手杀人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want a body on your hands?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.95,0:34:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲜血四溅 - 你给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blood everywhere?! - You shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可有很多对付恶霸的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I got lots of ways to take care of bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.79,0:34:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.37,0:34:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如那个联调局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that FBI guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.09,0:34:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你朋友 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your pal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.09,0:34:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你追克里夫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you chase Cliff down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.87,0:34:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名片刚被烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}his business card was torched.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.41,0:34:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,与我的一些私人秘藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with something from my…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.37,0:34:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}personal collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.47,0:34:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选了个对他来说很特别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I picked it out real special for him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.46,0:34:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一见到他 就注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as I saw him, I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.25,0:34:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直瞪着每一个神勇小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was staring at every little plucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.17,0:34:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像它要过来捅他一刀似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it was gonna stab him or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.06,0:35:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙很怕小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy's got a real thing about clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.06,0:35:16.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（就这会儿）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.01,0:35:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些玩偶 挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, these are, uh, really nice dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.93,0:35:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是你自己上色的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you paint them yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.35,0:35:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异的神勇小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, friggin' Plucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.23,0:35:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,神勇小丑帮助孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plucky helps kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.98,0:35:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来我只想做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I ever wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.20,0:35:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当竞选经理的机会来临时 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the management slot opened up, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.28,0:35:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们竟然没选我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they passed me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.66,0:35:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人惊讶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.42,0:35:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我跟他们说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I told them,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.14,0:35:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「没人比我更关心孩子了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No one cares more than me."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.42,0:35:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 大人物们从来不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But suits never listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.80,0:36:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我只好按自己的方式来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm doing it my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.20,0:36:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我理一理\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.02,0:36:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没得到好停车位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't get the good parking space,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.66,0:36:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以便大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you start dropping bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家长太可恶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those parents were horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.31,0:36:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}They deserved what they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.23,0:36:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那索尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Saul?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.90,0:36:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,索尔口风不牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saul had a big mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.85,0:36:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男人泡他家保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some guy hits on the babysitter,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.67,0:36:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就突然是世界上最烂的父亲了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of a sudden he's the world's worst dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.98,0:36:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好父母会把孩子放在首位\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good parent puts his kids first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.77,0:36:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一个小女孩眼睁睁看她爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And having a little girl watch her pop get ganked.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.17,0:36:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,被壁橱怪兽杀害 这叫把她放首位吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the closet monster … that's putting her first?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.87,0:36:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从长远角度看 他们都会过得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the long run, they'll all be better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.30,0:36:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think so? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了我就会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.41,0:36:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.52,0:36:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.93,0:36:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的错 是他们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault! It's theirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.37,0:37:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他是淹死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to me like he drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.61,0:37:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拼命呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was screaming…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.74,0:37:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my folks…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.48,0:37:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}they didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.33,0:37:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从来不听我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.07,0:37:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是场意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.82,0:37:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们造成了他的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let him die!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.79,0:37:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你仍然做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you still have nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.78,0:37:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你之后再也没下过水\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll bet you haven't been in the water since.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.89,0:37:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你心存恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.05,0:37:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.40,0:38:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.96,0:38:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.98,0:38:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.45,0:39:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.48,0:39:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.45,0:39:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来像被一群嗑粉脱衣舞娘攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you got attacked by some PCP-crazed strippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.02,0:39:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 其中一个用花管泼了我一身水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, one of them sprayed me with seltzer from his flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.43,0:39:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm s… whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.17,0:39:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.53,0:39:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.17,0:39:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.48,0:39:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.07,0:39:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.20,0:39:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 曾经吓得你留下心理阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for… psychologically scarring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.14,0:39:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是哪一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which time?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.47,0:39:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 咱们小的时候丢下你一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, me ditching you when we were kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.85,0:39:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是太混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was a dick move.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.11,0:39:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 怕小丑这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the whole clown thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.80,0:39:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 知道吗 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, man? Honestly…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.77,0:39:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚被那群小丑狠揍一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting my ass kicked by those juggalos tonight was…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.11,0:39:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺治愈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was therapeutic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.15,0:39:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你勇敢面对自己的恐惧 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You faced your fear. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.53,0:40:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 小丑可没法再伤害我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now what else could a clown possibly ever do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我感觉很好 - 恭喜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel good. - Well, congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.53,0:40:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 为了庆贺\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, to celebrate…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.37,0:40:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.59,0:40:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的假的 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.95,0:40:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是赢来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you win this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.84,0:40:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We earned that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.13,0:40:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我也有些小玩意给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I got you a little something, too, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.36,0:40:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你不是说没心理阴影了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You said you were over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.25,0:40:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把它当成一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can think of it as a…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.04,0:40:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小丑恐惧症治愈纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}clownphobia sobriety chip.
